# The files' columns' edge (DriveViews.tsx ColumnEdge: the library's edge, @sf.handle_drag, edge_look, edge_tip):
# MBUI_FIXTURE=drive MBUI_WIN=1280x800. The pointer over the column (its edge's bar shows), onto the edge (the bar
# longer, the line along it, its words by the pointer a moment later), the edge dragged 80 wider and let go, the pointer
# away and over the column again.
timeout 20000
until 设计稿
wait 600
hover 设计稿
wait 900
move 572 420
wait 1200
move 572 520
wait 600
drag 572 520 80 0 600
wait 900
move 1000 700
wait 600
hover 会议记录
wait 900
exit
